OL,3,GNEWSACounty lines drug dealer jailed
OL,4,Afor over four years
OL,5,
OL,6,FA drug dealer involved in a heroin and
OL,7,Fcrack cocaine drugs supply line between
OL,8,FWest and North Yorkshire and Lancashire
OL,9,Fhas been jailed for four and a half
OL,10,Fyears.
OL,12,FAccording to West Yorkshire Police,
OL,13,Fofficers from Operation Phoenix, the
OL,14,Fforce's county lines taskforce,
OL,15,Freceived details of a mobile number
OL,16,Fbeing used for drugs supply.
OL,18,FOfficers found texts showing drugs sold
OL,19,Fby the "Jake Line" were linked to Iyaz
OL,20,FIqbal, and a "significant" amount of
OL,21,Fdrugs and cash were found during a raid
OL,22,Fat his home in Keighley.
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
