OL,3,GNEWSACounty lines drug dealer jailed
OL,4,Afor over four years
OL,5,
OL,6,FIqbal, 37, of Whin Knoll Avenue,
OL,7,Fpleaded guilty to drugs offences,
OL,8,Fincluding possession and supply of
OL,9,Fheroin and crack cocaine, and was
OL,10,Fsentenced on Thursday at Bradford Crown
OL,11,FCourt.
